00:07:29.465 --> 00:07:32.825
in Italy, it was among the first,
as I said, maybe it wasn't the, the,

00:07:32.825 --> 00:07:40.290
the first uh, but it was among the
first examples of, of literature, uh,

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:46.500
literatures in, uh, vulgar languages
